<title>FRANCE: Michelin sells 2.6 pct in Peugeot.</title>
<headline>Michelin sells 2.6 pct in Peugeot.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tyre group Michelin said in a statement it had placed 1,309,000 shares in car group Peugeot, representing a stake of some 2.6 percent, to various institutional investors.</p>
<p>It did not give the price.</p>
<p>Michelin said it would keep a 3.5 percent stake and five percent voting stake.</p>
<p>&quot;The operation allows Michelin, while keeping the historical ties between the two houses, to pursue the reinforcement of its financial situation,&quot; the company said in a statement.</p>
</text>
